    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nMixed Commercial & Residential Property for Sale Prime Main Street Location, SwinfordAn excellent opportunity to acquire a mixed-use commercial and residential property in the heart of Swinford town. Ideally positioned on the Main Street, the property enjoys excellent frontage, high footfall, and convenient rear access.The ground floor comprises a well-presented commercial unit, currently tenanted, providing an immediate rental income. The property can be sold either with the existing tenant in place or with vacant possession, offering flexibility for investors and owner-occupiers alike.The residential accommodation is accessible to the rear and extends over three floors. The ground floor comprises a large kitchen while the first floor features a spacious living area and a generously sized ensuite bedroom. The second floor comprises two further bedrooms, one of which benefits from an ensuite. A large attic provides additional storage or potential for further use, subject to any necessary planning permissions.There is vehicular access to the rear of the building and a large yard area.Conveniently located within walking distance of all local amenities, this property represents an ideal investment or owner-occupier opportunity, combining a prime commercial location with comfortable residential accommodation.To see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nShop Space - 7.6m x 5.6m\nWith display windows and road frontage.\n\nWC - 1.7m x 1m\nWith WC and wash hand basin.\n\nTreatment Room - 2.5m x 4.1m\n\n\nHallway - 2.1m x 5.5m\nWith tile floor and staircase leading to the first floor.\n\nKitchen - 5.6m x 5.2m\nLarge kitchen with tile floor, fitted kitchen with tile splashback and an oil range with feature redbrick surround.\n\nPorch - 1.3m x 2.1m\nWith tile floor.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLiving Room - 5.8m x 5.5m\nLarge bright room on the first floor with solid timber floor, high celling, coving to the ceiling and open fireplace and two large windows allowing for lots of natural light.\n\nBathroom - 2.6m x 3.6m\nWith solid timber floor, half tiled walkls, WC, wash hand basin, and bathtub.\n\nSecond Floor - \n\n\nBedroom1 - 5.8m x 5.3m\nLarge double room on the second floor, to the front of the house with carpet floor and two large windows allowing for lots of natural light.\n\nEn-Suite - 2m x 1.8m\nFully tiled with WC, wash hand basin and shower.\n\nStorage/Walk-in Wardrobe - 1.5m x 1.8m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.8m x 3.9m\nDouble room on the second floor to the rear of the house with carpet floor.\n\nAttic Sapce - 8m x 5.8m\nWith high pitch roof.\n\nBedroom 3 - 5.2m x 2.5m\nDouble room to the rear of the house with lino floor.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.4m x 1.1m\nWith tiled floor, WC, wash hand basin and shower.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.4m x 3m\nDouble room to the rear of the house with lino floor.\n\n"
      },
